  "description": "To avenge his father, Jin-gwon spent ten grueling years in secluded training. But when he finally descends the mountain, what awaits him aren't his sworn enemies—it's a completely unrecognizable world.\n\nThe Murim has vanished, replaced by a fantasy era ruled by magical 'skills' and 'systems'.\n\nArmed with nothing but his ragged martial arts uniform and his bare fists, Jin-gwon looks like a relic of the past. But just because the era has changed, doesn't mean the true essence of strength has!\n\nIn a world that has discarded martial arts as obsolete, Jin-gwon is about to turn this new fantasy reality upside down with a single, devastating straight punch!\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851800), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14319936)",
